---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Report Government Fraud | GovLink" pathname="/fraud">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 mobile:py-12">
    <h1 class="type-site-hero text-center mb-8">Report Government Fraud</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8">
      <div class="bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 border border-amber-300 dark:border-amber-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-200 mb-3">⚠️ If you're in immediate danger, call 911</h2>
        <p class="text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300">This page helps you report fraud, waste, and abuse in government programs. It is not for emergencies.</p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Where to Report</h2>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Federal Fraud Hotlines</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3">
          <li>
            <strong>GAO FraudNet:</strong> <a href="https://www.gao.gov/fraudnet" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">gao.gov/fraudnet</a> — 1-800-424-5454
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>HHS OIG Hotline:</strong> <a href="https://oig.hhs.gov/fraud/report-fraud/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">oig.hhs.gov/fraud</a> — 1-800-447-8477 (Medicare/Medicaid fraud)
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>SSA OIG:</strong> <a href="https://oig.ssa.gov/report-fraud-waste-or-abuse" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">oig.ssa.gov</a> — 1-800-269-0271 (Social Security fraud)
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>VA OIG:</strong> <a href="https://www.va.gov/oig/hotline/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">va.gov/oig</a> — 1-800-488-8244 (Veterans benefits fraud)
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>IRS Tax Fraud:</strong> <a href="https://www.irs.gov/compliance/tax-fraud-reporting" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">irs.gov/tax-fraud</a> — Form 3949-A
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Online Reporting</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3">
          <li><a href="https://www.reportfraud.ftc.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">ReportFraud.ftc.gov</a> — Federal Trade Commission (identity theft, scams)</li>
          <li><a href="https://www.ic3.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">IC3.gov</a> — Internet Crime Complaint Center (FBI)</li>
          <li><a href="https://www.uspis.gov/report/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">USPIS.gov</a> — Postal Inspection Service (mail fraud)</li>
          <li><a href="https://oig.justice.gov/hotline" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">DOJ OIG</a> — Department of Justice Office of Inspector General</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Specific Program Fraud</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3">
          <li><strong>Medicare:</strong> 1-800-MEDICARE (1-800-633-4227)</li>
          <li><strong>Medicaid:</strong> Contact your state Medicaid Fraud Control Unit</li>
          <li><strong>SNAP/Food Stamps:</strong> Contact your state SNAP fraud hotline</li>
          <li><strong>Unemployment Insurance:</strong> Contact your state workforce agency</li>
          <li><strong>Disaster Relief:</strong> FEMA Fraud Hotline: 1-866-720-5721</li>
          <li><strong>Procurement/Contracting:</strong> Agency-specific OIG hotlines</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">What Information to Provide</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li>Who: Names, organizations, positions</li>
        <li>What: Description of the fraud, waste, or abuse</li>
        <li>When: Dates, timeframes, frequency</li>
        <li>Where: Locations, offices, programs</li>
        <li>How: Methods used, documents involved</li>
        <li>Evidence: Documents, emails, witnesses (if available)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Your Rights</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li>You can report anonymously</li>
        <li>Whistleblower protections may apply</li>
        <li>Your identity is protected to the maximum extent possible</li>
        <li>Retaliation for reporting is prohibited by law</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>